  animator: {fileID: 8396562659300982524}
  creditsClip: {fileID: 7400000, guid: 1842728e3595e25499177fcc42c83972, type: 2}
  stateName: EndingCreditsScroll
  bgmDurationSeconds: 56
  localizedLines:
  - target: {fileID: 4010545342235322610}
    japanese: "\u5168\u3066\u306E\u6575\u3092\u5012\u3057\u3001\u52C7\u8005\u306F\u5854\u3092\u5B88\u308A\u5207\u3063\u305F"
    english: The hero defeated every foe and defended the tower.
  - target: {fileID: 7948184442716670097}
    japanese: "\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3001\u3053\u306E\u52DD\u5229\u306F\u59CB\u307E\u308A\u306B\u904E\u304E\u306A\u3044"
    english: But this victory was only the beginning.
  - target: {fileID: 5882984350725849384}
    japanese: "\u3044\u305A\u308C\u307E\u305F\u73FE\u308C\u308B\u6575\u306B\u7ACB\u3061\u5411\u304B\u3046\u3060\u308D\u3046"
    english: When enemies rise again, the hero will face them.
  - target: {fileID: 7830044721617399786}
    japanese: "\u5E73\u548C\u304C\u8A2A\u308C\u308B\u305D\u306E\u65E5\u307E\u3067\u30FB\u30FB\u30FB"
    english: Until the day peace finally comes...
  - target: {fileID: 1094342463330870156}
    japanese: "\u30B2\u30FC\u30E0\u958B\u767A\u3000\u3057\u3085\u3093\u305F\u3080"
    english: 'Game Development: Shuntamu'
  - target: {fileID: 4975074800233775170}
    japanese: Thank you for playing!
    english: Thank you for playing!
